 "created": {
  "310721": "Each schedule shows its home location: \"Lines from Calgary South\"",
  "310722": "The Maintenance entry needs only Settings Service, not Digital Inspections",
  "310723": "The picker lists the home location's canned lines, with a helper",
  "310724": "Canned lines are read only for a user without access to the home location",
  "310725": "A 14-day or shorter interval drops the default before row",
  "310726": "A duplicate keeps the original's home location and canned lines",
  "310727": "The confidence meter's hover ends with the estimate disclaimer",
  "310728": "Mark complete sits in the row menu and opens \"Mark PM-A complete\"",
  "310729": "\"Where was it done?\" lists work orders from every location",
  "310730": "Reset date defaults: today, or the day the lines closed",
  "310731": "Completed elsewhere asks for a Reset date and optional shop and reading",
  "310732": "Mark complete on a compliance service takes the certificate",
  "310733": "Mark complete resets at once; added lines wait for the invoice",
  "310734": "After Mark complete: toast with Undo, Completed row, Undo complete",
  "310735": "Undo complete only for the latest Mark complete",
  "310736": "Mark complete on a work order records its mileage as a reading",
  "310737": "A completed row rests until its first reminder; Needs readings stays",
  "310738": "Create work order at another location adds the same work, not the lines",
  "310739": "Opening a work order from another location offers to switch location",
  "310740": "New lists show a loading state and an error with Retry",
  "310741": "Hover cards open by keyboard and by tap, and Esc closes them",
  "310742": "Settings, the asset tab and enrolment work on a phone",
  "310743": "View-only customers user: tabs readable, every change hidden",
  "310744": "Work-order actions follow work-order and invoicing permissions",
  "310745": "Send reminder is offered when any contact has an email"
 },
